#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:omc_website.view_use_cases
msgid ""
"Your sales reps check customer history on the way in, update the opportunity"
" on the way out, and send the quote from the parking lot. No more \"I'll do "
"it when I'm back at the office\"."
msgstr ""
"Tus vendedores revisan el historial del cliente antes de entrar, actualizan "
